  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Planting Change: Youth Collaboration for Ethical Food Futures</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This preparatory study will bring together youth-led organizations from Denmark and Argentina to explore the development of a cross-cultural educational project on plant-based living and sustainability. Through a one-week physical exchange, the partners will deepen their understanding of each other&#xfffd;s structures, values, and capacities. The study will focus on youth participation, democratic practices, and the potential to co-create school-based programs that engage students in both countries through shared learning, cultural exchange, and advocacy for ethical food systems.</narrative>
  </description>
